    ["Turn on stacking for enemy nameplates."] = "Turn on stacking for enemy nameplates.",
    ["Turn on stacking for friendly nameplates."] = "Turn on stacking for friendly nameplates.",
    ["Tweak the vertical position of the clickable area."] = "Tweak the vertical position of the clickable area.",
    ["When not casting, shows who the unit is targeting.\nWhen casting, cast target always has priority."] = "When not casting, shows who the unit is targeting.\nWhen casting, cast target always has priority.",
    ["With default settings BG Objectives will still show on nameplates regardless of your friendly/enemy preference. This can all be tuned in Advanced Settings.\nYou could even disable Class Indicator on both and have it show only BG Objectives."] = "With default settings BG Objectives will still show on nameplates regardless of your friendly/enemy preference. This can all be tuned in Advanced Settings.\nYou could even disable Class Indicator on both and have it show only BG Objectives.",
    ["www.twitch.tv/snupy"] = "www.twitch.tv/snupy",
    ["You can turn off half-size and adjust size in settings below."] = "You can turn off half-size and adjust size in settings below.",
    ["You can turn off square and adjust size in settings below."] = "You can turn off square and adjust size in settings below.",
    ["|A:gmchat-icon-blizz:16:16|a Better|cff00c0ffBlizz|rPlates: Leave combat to open settings for the first time."] = "|A:gmchat-icon-blizz:16:16|a Better|cff00c0ffBlizz|rPlates: Leave combat to open settings for the first time.",
    ["|A:gmchat-icon-blizz:16:16|a Better|cff00c0ffBlizz|rPlates: Show Friendly Pets CVar toggled on for Pet Class Indicator to work. If you want to turn this back off go to /bbp -> CVar Control and uncheck it."] = "|A:gmchat-icon-blizz:16:16|a Better|cff00c0ffBlizz|rPlates: Show Friendly Pets CVar toggled on for Pet Class Indicator to work. If you want to turn this back off go to /bbp -> CVar Control and uncheck it.",
    ["|A:gmchat-icon-blizz:16:16|aBetter|cff00c0ffBlizz|rPlates Cata Beta v0.1.1b:\n\nFixed Retail-look Nameplate Height Slider. You might have to re-adjust/reset it back to 1."] = "|A:gmchat-icon-blizz:16:16|aBetter|cff00c0ffBlizz|rPlates Cata Beta v0.1.1b:\n\nFixed Retail-look Nameplate Height Slider. You might have to re-adjust/reset it back to 1.",
    ["|A:gmchat-icon-blizz:16:16|aBetter|cff00c0ffBlizz|rPlates: Leave combat to Import"] = "|A:gmchat-icon-blizz:16:16|aBetter|cff00c0ffBlizz|rPlates: Leave combat to Import",
    ["|A:groupfinder-icon-class-rogue:16:16|a |cfffff569Nahj Profile|r"] = "|A:groupfinder-icon-class-rogue:16:16|a |cfffff569Nahj Profile|r",
    ["|A:plunderstorm-pickup-mouseclick-left:16:16|aLook & Behaviour"] = "|A:plunderstorm-pickup-mouseclick-left:16:16|aLook & Behaviour",
    ["|cff6699ffBlue: Nameplate Box Height|r\nThe invisible nameplate size. This will be the max area allowed to click, the size that stacking nameplates care about (+- overlap values), and what some addons anchor their stuff to (some anchor directly to the healthbar instead).\n\n\n|cffff6666Red: Stacking Zone|r\nWhen the stacking zone of two nameplates touch they will begin to stack.\n\n\n|cff66cc66Green: Valid Click Area|r\nYour click area has to be inside of the |cff6699ffblue|r nameplate box. If you do not see |cff66cc66green|r you've moved the healthbar outside of the allowed click area and nothing will be clickable."] = "|cff6699ffBlue: Nameplate Box Height|r\nThe invisible nameplate size. This will be the max area allowed to click, the size that stacking nameplates care about (+- overlap values), and what some addons anchor their stuff to (some anchor directly to the healthbar instead).\n\n\n|cffff6666Red: Stacking Zone|r\nWhen the stacking zone of two nameplates touch they will begin to stack.\n\n\n|cff66cc66Green: Valid Click Area|r\nYour click area has to be inside of the |cff6699ffblue|r nameplate box. If you do not see |cff66cc66green|r you've moved the healthbar outside of the allowed click area and nothing will be clickable.",
    ["\n|cff32f795Right-click to also hide CD Text on Buffs & CC.|r"] = "\n|cff32f795Right-click to also hide CD Text on Buffs & CC.|r",
    ["\n|cff32f795Right-click to change anchor: "] = "\n|cff32f795Right-click to change anchor: ",
    ["\n|cff32f795Right-click to keep totem names shown.\nNote: Expects only Enemy Totems and Enemy Pets enabled in CVar Control. Otherwise it will keep the name shown for the other categories as well.|r"] = "\n|cff32f795Right-click to keep totem names shown.\nNote: Expects only Enemy Totems and Enemy Pets enabled in CVar Control. Otherwise it will keep the name shown for the other categories as well.|r",
    ["A basic starter profile that only enables the few things you need.\n\nIntended to work as a very minimal quick start that can be built upon."] = "A basic starter profile that only enables the few things you need.\n\nIntended to work as a very minimal quick start that can be built upon.",
    ["A lot of other features might also not work 100% in this Alpha version. Keep an eye out for errors."] = "A lot of other features might also not work 100% in this Alpha version. Keep an eye out for errors.",
    ["A more advanced profile enabling a few more settings and customizing things a bit more.\n\nGreat for Battlegrounds (and Arenas) with Class Icons showing Healers, Tanks and Battleground Objectives."] = "A more advanced profile enabling a few more settings and customizing things a bit more.\n\nGreat for Battlegrounds (and Arenas) with Class Icons showing Healers, Tanks and Battleground Objectives.",
    ["Absorb Indicator |A:Ping_Chat_Assist:18:18|a"] = "Absorb Indicator |A:Ping_Chat_Assist:18:18|a",
    ["Adjust the extra clickable height of nameplates.\n\nNOTE: This changes the effectiveness of Nameplate Stacking.\n\nYou may have to enter values on the Horizontal & Vertical Overlap sliders in CVar Control section to something larger than the default values. You can right click the slider to input custom values that are higher than what the slider normally allows. The overlap value is percent based from the nameplates clickable height."] = "Adjust the extra clickable height of nameplates.\n\nNOTE: This changes the effectiveness of Nameplate Stacking.\n\nYou may have to enter values on the Horizontal & Vertical Overlap sliders in CVar Control section to something larger than the default values. You can right click the slider to input custom values that are higher than what the slider normally allows. The overlap value is percent based from the nameplates clickable height.",
