    ["|cffffffffNote: Buggy and experimental version. Some stuff might still be in the UI but be scheduled for removal due to restrictions. Still a lot of work left for a finished version. Please use BugSack and BugGrabber and report any errors.\n\nThe new Blizzard Nameplate preview window is not intended to work atm, please use real nameplates to judge settings for now.\n\nAlways reload after UI tweaks to confirm working/broken.\n\n|cff00ff00Settings you might want to try:|cffffffff\nReposition Name (Advanced Settings)\nSeparate Friendly/Enemy Nameplate Height (Misc)\n"] = "|cffffffffNote: Buggy and experimental version. Some stuff might still be in the UI but be scheduled for removal due to restrictions. Still a lot of work left for a finished version. Please use BugSack and BugGrabber and report any errors.\n\nThe new Blizzard Nameplate preview window is not intended to work atm, please use real nameplates to judge settings for now.\n\nAlways reload after UI tweaks to confirm working/broken.\n\n|cff00ff00Settings you might want to try:|cffffffff\nReposition Name (Advanced Settings)\nSeparate Friendly/Enemy Nameplate Height (Misc)\n",
